# PII fields

Data about people that this project handles and how each field is masked in logs. `.claude/rules/security.md` and
`/observability` read this. When unsure whether a field is sensitive, add it. Delete the example row once you add
real ones.

| Field | Where it appears | In logs |
|---|---|---|
| `email` | Example only: `users` table, signup requests | Never logged; log the user ID instead |

Masking options: never logged; last 2–4 characters only; a one-way hash; a truncated ID.
